WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.509
Use the Learning Path for this one task.

00:00:03.509 --> 00:00:05.263
Orient states the destination.

00:00:05.263 --> 00:00:09.649
Connect recognizes the existing drafting skill and new input-selection need.

00:00:09.649 --> 00:00:11.841
Explain gives the permitted-information rule.

00:00:11.841 --> 00:00:16.227
Show selects the invented details and corrects the unsupported approval.

00:00:16.227 --> 00:00:21.051
Practice gives a new invented inquiry for the participant to complete.

00:00:21.051 --> 00:00:25.437
Review checks excluded information, accurate meaning and the human reviewer.

00:00:25.437 --> 00:00:30.700
Apply locates the action in the same project under its actual permissions.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.208
Continue invites correction or the next bounded practice.

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:39.471
Ask AI to help only after supplying the audience need and policy.

00:00:39.471 --> 00:00:43.418
Remove invented commitments and restore any missing participation step.

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:51.313
Provide written source details, a worked draft, the exercise and the same review criterion as an accessible alternative.

00:00:51.313 --> 00:00:56.137
The participant must be able to act and check the result.
